vaevictis-desktop (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First version: the look of VaeVictis OS 1.3 for systems installed from
    1.1 or 1.2 (icons, dark style, Blur my Shell, Ptyxis, boot menu, boot
    screen resolution).
  * Fixes from an AI-assisted review (Argon by Google; not an independent
    security audit), before publication: a GRUB_GFXPAYLOAD_LINUX of your
    own is kept too; an existing resolution file is never rewritten; when
    the boot menu is already the 1.3 one, nothing is copied again and
    update-grub does not run.

